  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "**Breaking:** Ahwoo.BRUTAL.Fmod no longer ships the vendored FMOD binaries; consumers supply their own licensed copy of FMOD.\n\nThe binaries move to a new binaries-only package, RocketWerkz.Brutal.Fmod.Native (internal use only, no package dependencies). It packs `runtimes/<rid>/native/` for win-x64, linux-x64 and osx-arm64, and copies the host's binaries to the output of project-reference consumers. The FMOD third-party notices move with the binaries.\n\nNo public API changes.\n\n**Full Changelog:** [v2026.10.2...v2026.10.3](https://github.com/RocketWerkz/brutal.fmod/compare/v2026.10.2...v2026.10.3)",
